1. Sabse pehle asli weakness fix karta
Mere live GitHub check mein reos-development branch ka protected status false mila. Live branch status

Iska matlab hai ki current workflow mein code canonical branch par save ho sakta hai aur CI uske baad fail ho sakta hai. CI failure detect karta hai; bina branch protection ke woh khud se galat change ko canonical branch mein aane se nahi rokta.

Isliye mera pehla decision hoga:
P0 — Protect the delivery process
1. GitHub Settings mein reos-development ke liye pull request required karna.
2. Backend/ACRL aur frontend ke actual CI checks ko merge conditions banana.
3. PRs par required checks hamesha generate hon, isliye existing workflow path filters ko carefully adjust karna. Sirf kisi job ko required mark karna enough nahi hai agar woh kuch changes par trigger hi na ho.
4. Branch ko latest base se updated rakhna aur force-push/delete ko block karna.

GitHub protected branches aur rulesets required reviews aur successful CI checks ke bina merging ko rok sakte hain. GitHub protected branches · Required status checks

Tum phir bhi GitHub Web UI se hi code save karoge—bas direct canonical branch par commit karne ke bajay nayi branch aur PR ka use hoga. Local development zaroori nahi hai.
